(text "WIZ850io: one footprint with both 1x6 sockets (J1 = pads 1-6, J2 = pads 7-12), rows 17.78 mm (0.7 in) apart." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c162f016-ce11-4bdd-a70c-4da3cd8338f9))
(text "The W5500 is polled (no interrupt). JP3 routes INTn to expander 2 P06 if polling is not enough." (at 20.32 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5932d9d1-c559-4830-9f81-10df9da03b22))
(text "microSD on the ESP32-S3 SD host, 1-bit mode. JP1 can disconnect DAT0 from GPIO3 (a strapping pin) if it upsets boot." (at 20.32 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 74d46b31-cb0e-4976-9b3e-1a7a5297d421))
